#: contents/ui/config/configCommand.qml:202
msgid ""
"The list and usage commands must emit JSON, one object per line (Docker 23 "
"and newer) or a single array (Podman). “Look for changes” gets {since} and "
"{until} as unix times and must print a line for each relevant event; if it "
"fails, plain interval polling is used instead. The engine summary must emit "
